OL,3,AAsylum centre on military base near
OL,4,APiddington approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to house asylum seekers at a
OL,7,Fformer military site near the
OL,8,FOxfordshire village of Piddington have
OL,9,Fbeen approved by the government.
OL,11,FPlanning permission for housing for up
OL,12,Fto 1,256 men at the MoD Bicester site
OL,13,Fwas approved by the Housing Secretary
OL,14,FAngela Rayner after the Home Office
OL,15,Fused a fast-track route for projects
OL,16,Fdeemed to be urgently needed and of
OL,17,Fnational importance.
OL,19,FThe Home Office said this would allow
OL,20,Fit to continue developing the plan but
OL,21,Fthat no final decision on the site had
OL,22,Fbeen taken.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
